        "rendered_text": "CFM.SYS.OnLastWindowClose\n--- Steps ---\n   # This script is meant to run upon solution close\n   # ==========================================\n   \n   # -once called this script should not be muted\n   Allow User Abort [ Off ]\n   \n   # -exit script if on server\n   If [ PatternCount ( Get ( ApplicationVersion ) ; \"Server\" ) > 0\nor PatternCount ( Get ( ApplicationVersion ) ; \"OData\" ) > 0 ]\n   Exit Script [  ]\n   End If\n   \n   # -go to the splash screen, set window size\n   Go to Layout [ \"CFM.CORPUSfm_DB\" ]\n   Perform Script [ \"CFM.COMMON.SetScreenSize\" ; Parameter:  ]\n   Show/Hide Menubar [ Show ]\n   Show/Hide Toolbars [ Show ]\n   \n   # -keep FileMaker open\n   If [ ValueCount ( DatabaseNames ) = 1 ]\n   Open Favorites\n   End If\n   ",
